{
	"id": "rsreforged",
	"title": "RSReforged",
	"description": "RSReforged (Ready Set Roll for D&D5e) for Foundry V14 and dnd5e 6. Upstream RSReforged 6.0.0 with a Card Style setting (Classic RSReforged sections, or Vanilla+: dnd5e 6's own compact roll rows on one card with advantage / critical / bonus buttons in the roll breakdown), the wide saving throw button on Classic cards, and the GMC extras: damage tray facelift with a temp HP mode, fully hidden private rolls with a GM reveal control, and fast-forward rolls with Shift to configure.",
